{{Term/Store|Snowquill Tunic|Snowquill Tunics|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Locations and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Snowquill Tunics are pieces of [[Armor]] that can be bought for 600 [[Rupee]]s at the [[Brazen Beak]]. When worn, a Snowquill Tunic provides one level of [[Cold Resistance]]. Theu can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and [[Hateno Dye|Dyed]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. Snowquill Tunics, alongside [[Snowquill Headdress]]es and [[Snowquill Trousers]], compose the [[Snowquill Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Unfreezable]] [[Set Bonus]].

